From 0eb3532c39e5136f11541b068c3d7326a4fdaab9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Rinehart <johnrichardrinehart@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 16:14:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] keyboard: add configurable line scrolling

Monstar supports page and boundary scrollback navigation. It has no
shortcut for one-line movement.

Handle one-line navigation on the primary screen. Let users set each
shortcut. Use Shift+Up and Shift+Down by default. Keep alternate-screen
input unchanged.
